%% Lab 01: two calls to Chat Completions. Our code (lime notes) builds and sends the whole message list each time;
%% the model (ink) answers from that list only and keeps nothing between the calls.
%% Export: npx -y @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i lab01_message_list.mmd -o lab01_message_list.png -b white -s 2
sequenceDiagram
    participant Code as Our code<br>(holds the list)
    participant Model as Chat Completions API<br>(the model)

    Note over Code: messages = [system,<br>user: order number 46]
    Code->>Model: create(messages): 2 messages
    Model-->>Code: assistant reply
    Note over Model: keeps nothing<br>after the reply
    Note over Code: history = [system,<br>user: order number 46,<br>assistant: the reply,<br>user: what is my<br>order number?]
    Code->>Model: create(history): 4 messages
    Model-->>Code: "Your order number is 46."
    Note over Code,Model: the model knew 46 only because<br>our code sent it again
